# Indian Road Accident Analysis Dashboard

## 📊 Project Overview

An interactive Power BI dashboard designed to analyze Indian road accident data and identify patterns related to accident severity, location, time, road conditions, environment, casualties, and risk.

## 🎯 Objective

The objective of this project is to transform raw road accident data into meaningful visual insights that can help users understand accident trends and identify high-risk areas and conditions.

## 🛠️ Tools & Technologies

- Power BI
- SQL
- DAX
- Data Visualization
- Data Cleaning & Transformation

## 📌 Dashboard Features

### Executive Overview
- Total Accidents
- Total Casualties
- Fatal Accidents
- Average Risk Score
- Monthly Accident Trends
- Accident Severity Distribution

### Location Analysis
- Highest Accident State
- Highest Accident City
- Highest Risk City
- Accident Distribution by Location
- Top 10 States by Accidents

### Time Analysis
- Weekend vs Weekday Analysis
- Peak Accident Hour
- Average Daily Accidents
- Accident Trends by Date
- Day-of-Week Analysis

### Environment Analysis
- Weather Conditions
- Visibility
- Environmental factors affecting accidents

### Road Analysis
- Road Type
- Number of Lanes
- Traffic Density
- Traffic Signals

### Casualty Analysis
- Casualty trends
- Accident severity
- Casualty distribution

### Risk Analysis
- Risk Score analysis
- High-risk locations
- Factors associated with accident risk

